{{Term/Store|Razorclaw Crab|Razorclaw Crabs|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s and [[Creature]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Razorclaw Crab}}
Razorclaw Crabs can be found near [[Water (Terrain)|Water]], usually along beaches in the [[Necluda Sea]] and [[East Necluda]]. They will scurry away if approached, but they can be easily caught by [[Link]] when snuck up on. Eating one raw will restore one of [[Link]]'s [[Heart]]s to his [[Life Gauge]]. They can also be exposed to [[Fire]] to make [[Blackened Crab]] or chilled by [[Ice]] to make [[Frozen Crab]]. [[Meal]]s made in a [[Cooking Pot]] using Razorclaw Crabs will temporarily increase Link's attack damage via the [[Attack Up]] [[Added Effect]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

When [[Cooking]], either a Razorclaw Crab or any other [[Crab]] is required to make the following Meals:
